# Audited: @Notes's label is place 0 and @Note's, inlined transparently, takes the caller's place 1 (Semantics ch. 8); each text follows from its clause.
# The clause widget's tests: declarations of be-clause-widget.prism (Semantics chapter 6).

test the_clause_is_chosen_at_the_build, @Notes (? "Mine"):
    build
        => expect Ui.Label(text="Mine: first")

test the_other_clause, @Notes nil:
    build
        => expect Ui.Label(text="untitled: first")
